  "project_description": "This module provides the ability to change the Gin Toolbar menu for specific user roles.\n\n \n \n ⚠️ Info \n This module requires the Gin Toolbar module and the Gin Admin Theme . \n\n \n \n Back to top \n\n Installation \n \n Normal module installation procedure. \n \n \n Back to top \n\n Dependencies \n Gin Toolbar \n\n \n Back to top \n\n Configuration \n Go to \"/admin/config/system/gin-toolbar-custom-menu\" and select the menu you\n\nwanto to show and the user roles you wanto to show it to.\n\n \n Back to top \n\n Credits \n Powered by Javali \n\n Back to top",
